	Introduction, Preface

	Well here is another stripper, I thought it was very annoying
	that you as a user had to see all the files in the LHA archive
	while it was being tested.. I remember the Magic WorkBench
	package with 200 files or more which filled several screens
	with file checking information, I had enough!

	This LHA stripper doesn't show any file information, more than
	that the file is OK. It also shows how many bytes was saved
	due to the banner stripping. It's very fast and small, fully
	coded in SAS C 6.5!

	If you feel that it doesn't strip as fast as your old one
	it may be the new strip file which follows with this util!
	The strip file is packed with 800 different adds + several
	wildcards. Only the wildcards will remove most of your adds
	so if you want more speed, remove all adds that doens't have
	a wilcard in the name (Wildcards = #, #?, *) and you will
	see the full speed of this util!

