	Instalation ..

	Copy the files in the FCheck directory to your BBS:FCheck dir.
	Copy the MasterStripper to your BBS:Utils directory, or anywhere if
	you change the location in the BBS:FCheck icons tooltypes!
	Copy the S/Lha.strip file to your S:Directory. This is a standard
	file strip file for LHA and you may use / add your old files
	to this file for even more banners removed.

	If you by some stupied reason would like to have some adds
	of yours added to the files you just create a directory with
	all the files you wanna add and change in the FCheck tooltypes
	Options=Directory_Path and tell the location of your addy dir and
	all adds in the specified directory will be added! :)

	NOTE! This util works very well in CLI and in DiskMaster / Opus.
	      I use it inside DiskMaster in the meny and only have to
	      mark a file and choose strip and MasterStripper does the
	      work for me.. (Really nice to get rid of all adds before
	      unpacking some LHA archive..)

