	History

	05-14-94 V1.00 (Not Released only for Beta Testing!)

	First version... Made in apx 4 hours!

	06-14-94 V1.01

	REALLY debugged version.. It has now been running on 3 boards
	for 1 months time and has managed well. Several "bugs" in
	the strip file has been removed and the program has worked
	well on over 2000 LHA archives!

